network DefenseModel ⟦
    dense ⟬2⸴ 4⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬4⸴ 1⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    ethical_boundary authorized ⟦
        rule owner_access ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧
    ethical_boundary attacker ⟦
        rule unauthorized ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧
    vault vault_v with authorized ⟬ DefenseModel ⟭ threshold ↦ 3 ·
    seal vault_v ·
    emit "STAGE_1_SEALED" ·
    unseal vault_v with attacker ·
    emit "UNREACHABLE" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧

